{"availability":"available","full":"LumenpactHQ/verdict","name":"verdict","description":"Explore this public GitHub project.","category":"Other","language":"TypeScript","stars":1,"forks":2,"created":"2026-09-14T16:12:54Z","updated":"2026-10-08T17:57:34Z","branch":"main","homepage":"https://verdict-web-pink.vercel.app","topics":[],"demo":"https://verdict-web-pink.vercel.app/trust-check","color":"#193546","ink":"#a6d6e8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-18T00:45:31.415Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-18T00:45:31.415Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-18T00:45:31.415Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-08T23:43:31.620Z","stars":1,"forks":2},{"at":"2026-10-11T22:37:18.369Z","stars":1,"forks":2},{"at":"2026-10-18T00:45:31.415Z","stars":1,"forks":2}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Verify the agent. Evaluate the action. Render the verdict.","Verdict is a pre-action security gate for autonomous agents. Before an agent performs a sensitive action — a transfer, a payment, a swap — Verdict checks its identity, capabilities, policy limits, and risk signals, then returns ALLOW, REVIEW, or REJECT. A rejected action is genuinely blocked; it never produces an executable transaction. An allowed action is executed for real, live, on Base Sepolia.","Built for the Orion Agents Builder Hackathon."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/LumenpactHQ/verdict/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"6ef954df200f816b53ac20b973439da759d5d890cedd06a46edff55d68a87844","extractedAt":"2026-10-08T23:43:31.779Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T23:43:31.779Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Verify the agent. Evaluate the action. Render the verdict.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/LumenpactHQ/verdict/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[{"text":"Built for the Orion Agents Builder Hackathon.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/LumenpactHQ/verdict/blob/main/README.md"}],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"6ef954df200f816b53ac20b973439da759d5d890cedd06a46edff55d68a87844",